| s_axi_control | CTRL            | 0x00   | 32    | RW     | Control signals                  | 0=AP_START 1=AP_DONE 2=AP_IDLE 3=AP_READY 7=AUTO_RESTART 9=INTERRUPT |
| s_axi_control | GIER            | 0x04   | 32    | RW     | Global Interrupt Enable Register | 0=Enable                                                             |
| s_axi_control | IP_IER          | 0x08   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Enable Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_EN 1=CHAN1_INT_EN                                        |
| s_axi_control | IP_ISR          | 0x0c   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Status Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_ST 1=CHAN1_INT_ST                                        |
| s_axi_control | tpsf_in_lane0_1 | 0x10   | 32    | W      | Data signal of tpsf_in_lane0     |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | tpsf_in_lane0_2 | 0x14   | 32    | W      | Data signal of tpsf_in_lane0     |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | tpsf_in_lane1_1 | 0x1c   | 32    | W      | Data signal of tpsf_in_lane1     |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | tpsf_in_lane1_2 | 0x20   | 32    | W      | Data signal of tpsf_in_lane1     |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | tpsf_in_lane2_1 | 0x28   | 32    | W      | Data signal of tpsf_in_lane2     |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | tpsf_in_lane2_2 | 0x2c   | 32    | W      | Data signal of tpsf_in_lane2     |                                                                      |
